  <Title type="string">Against what the gallery cleaner threw away</Title>
  <synopsis type="string">Bartholomew Nakamura talks about a portrait of the wind, from behind. The artist answered every question with a question, and then with a long pause, which the transcript renders as "…".</synopsis>
